      {
        "description": "The endpoint will be assessed by MEDI-LITE (Mediterranean Literature) questionnaire that will be submitted to patients. Adherence to the Mediterranean diet assessed through the Medi-Lite score was found to be associated with abdominal obesity. The final score, obtained by summing these values, varies from 0 (low adherence) to 18 (high adherence).",
