        "description": "While evaluating safety and tolerability of safinamide, 200 mg od, compared with placebo, severity of TEAEs, their relationship to study drug, their seriousness and their consequences were assessed. TEAEs were defined as adverse events (AEs) that started after the first dose of study drug.",
