        "description": "To evaluate the potential efficacy of safinamide 200 mg od, as add-on therapy, on quality of life (change in anterior displacement). The goniometric measurement consists in the posture evaluation of the patient, measuring through a goniometer the angle of the flexion of the trunk. Goniometric measurement of \"anterior\" displacement was determined using a wall goniometer and expressing the value in degrees in the range of 0 to 90.",
